* DelayedPublicMutable\non Aztec
** The problem
*** Private functions are proved\nagainst an anchor block
*** Historical read proves the past,\nnot the present
*** PublicMutable has no private read
** Option 1: enqueue a public check
*** only_self public assert
*** Exact and immediate
*** Publishes contract + selector\n(a countable transfer event)
** Option 2: DelayedPublicMutable
*** Writes are scheduled: now + delay
*** Private read = historical read\n+ time horizon
*** set_expiration_timestamp(horizon)
*** Delay decrease waits the difference,\nincrease is immediate
*** ~4k constraints per read,\npack values into one struct
** What the delay costs
*** Inclusion window = delay\n(default MAX_TX_LIFETIME = 24 h)
*** Kernel keeps the minimum\nacross all functions
*** expiration - anchor is public:\nprivacy-set fingerprint
*** Pending change = public deadline
** Unsuitable for emergency pause
*** Pause lands only at t0 + D
*** Short D = tight window + unique fingerprint
*** Long D = hours-long pause window
*** Hybrid: delayed config,\npublic kill switch
** Choosing the delay
*** One delay per contract
*** Match ecosystem values
*** Seconds, not blocks
*** Budget against proving time
@endmindmap
